{"ticker":{"symbol":"128660.KQ","name":"피제이메탈","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":2770.0,"change_pct":0.018382352941176405,"market_cap":68705329152.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.061371841155234655,"week52_low":2450.0,"week52_high":4140.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Aluminum","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":59,"website":"https://www.pjmetal.co.kr","business_summary":"PJ Metal Co., Ltd. engages in the manufacturing of aluminum deoxidizers and billets in South Korea. The company's aluminum deoxidizers include pellets, mini-pellets, and shot deoxidizers, which are used to remove the oxygen contained in molten iron. It also offers aluminum flux, which consists of slab stabilizers and deoxidizers that enhances the yield rate of valid ingredients in the molten iron; and aluminum billets for applications in materials for construction and industrial parts, as well as for vehicle, and electricity and electronics in factories for pressing out. PJ Metal Co., Ltd. was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"피제이메탈(주)는 한국에서 알루미늄 탈산제 및 빌렛을 제조하는 회사입니다. 회사의 알루미늄 탈산소제는 쇳물 속에 함유된 산소를 제거하는데 사용되는 펠렛(Pellet), 미니펠렛(Mini-Pellet), 쇼트(Shot) 탈산제 등이 있다. 또한 용선에서 유효한 성분의 수율을 향상시키는 슬래브 안정제와 탈산제로 구성된 알루미늄 플럭스를 제공합니다. 건축자재, 산업부품용, 자동차용, 공장의 전기전자용 압출용 알루미늄 빌렛 등이 있습니다. PJ Metal Co., Ltd.는 1984년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"알루미늄","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":269048598650.0,"operating_income":10373344730.0,"net_income":5782322160.0,"eps":233.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":229349317990.0,"operating_income":5254157180.0,"net_income":13268678440.0,"eps":535.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":254485502210.0,"operating_income":9170810300.0,"net_income":2824868830.0,"eps":114.0},{"period":"2025","reven